{"3826670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flipping is Hard", "steam_appid": 3826670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Flippin' Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/fe34b3e30de4242c7eaf9726484d724a.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your <strong>sanity</strong>, your <strong>phone skills</strong>, and your <strong>friendships</strong>. You can either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo:</strong> like some insane person who loves to suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online CO-OP:</strong> and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)<strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Flippy - the Brickphone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this happened because little Jeff <strong>slipped on a strategically placed banana peel</strong> and <strong>yeeted the phone</strong> into a storm drain... Now <strong>Jeff and Flippy are separated</strong> and feeling sad...  But <strong>You have the power</strong> <strong>to fix this!</strong> Use your phone-flipping skills to reunite them and give them a happy ending!        </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/17e2d7c31c2294066065a68e753949e0.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate-Only Movement</strong> – Flippy doesn't have legs... Your only movements are rotation and a vibration jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Climb </strong>– Small mistake, big drop. 10 different childhood areas and a clear goal - reach the top and reunite with little Jeff.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/497f99a315c403f8095764957fa54026.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-Op Chaos</strong> – 1–4 players. Pull friends up. Drop them “by accident.” Friendship DLC not included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Challenges</strong> – Meet quirky characters, uncover weird lore, and most importantly, TRY to complete their platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Ready </strong>– Quick restarts are implemented so you can efficiently torture yourself with speedruns. Master the way of Flippy and make your way back to Jeff as soon as possible!<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint Assist (Optional)</strong> – A softer mode for when your soul needs a hug. Insane people will flame you. Use it anyway.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/08f1fbf9dcd9d8fddac3366906f10d39.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fashionista Flippy </strong>– Customize Flippy with different phone cases, charms, and stickers! Even a phone always wants to look its best.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you Have Games on your Phone? </strong>– The answer is yes! Find, unlock, and play classic mobile games from the past. Truly a game-ception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Calls </strong>– Answer random calls for Jeff and listen to all the tea. Some are heartwarming from Mom, but others can be a little more on the sketchy side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience. Falling is part of the challenge. Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your <strong>sanity</strong>, your <strong>phone skills</strong>, and your <strong>friendships</strong>. You can either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Solo:</strong> like some insane person who loves to suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online CO-OP:</strong> and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)<strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Flippy - the Brickphone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/f741e90c0bd1e24800f5dcb8c30f73dd.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak