n a phone always wants to look its best.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you Have Games on your Phone? </strong>– The answer is yes! Find, unlock, and play classic mobile games from the past. Truly a game-ception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Calls </strong>– Answer random calls for Jeff and listen to all the tea. Some are heartwarming from Mom, but others can be a little more on the sketchy side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience. Falling is part of the challenge. Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.poster.avif?t=1785735778\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.webm?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/extras/086fbf9a4cb7b084e51138dd8a9da11a.mp4?t=1785735778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A flippin' hard solo/coop game where rotation is your only motion. Flip, fall, and climb through the land of lost things to return to your boy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826670/18e27c43c6b7805af228c4f5f1308430fd2811e2/header.jpg?t=1785735778", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a